\f0\b Talk track:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93I use DevBoard for things like gameplay loops, mechanics, progression, scope checks, and random ideas I don\'92t want to lose. The canvas is great for mapping the loop, and the notes are right there when something needs more detail.\'94\

\f0\b Show:
