\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Hook:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93Novel writing is basically controlled chaos.\'94\

\f0\b Talk track:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93You\'92ve got characters, scenes, timelines, themes, random lines of dialogue, and that one note called \'91ending maybe.\'92 DevBoard gives you a place to keep all of that together without turning it into a database project.\'94\

\f0\b Show:
