\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Hook:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93I don\'92t want another dashboard. I want somewhere to put the thing I\'92m thinking about.\'94\

\f0\b Talk track:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93DevBoard isn\'92t trying to run your life. It\'92s just a workspace for ideas. Notes, links, files, and a board when words are not enough.\'94\

