\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Hook:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93I\'92m tired of every notes app needing an account before I can write one sentence.\'94\

\f0\b Talk track:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93With DevBoard, you open a folder and start writing. Your stuff lives on your computer. No sign-up wall, no workspace invite, no cloud by default.\'94\

