\f0\b Talk track:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93I keep tabs open because I\'92m afraid I\'92ll forget why I opened them. DevBoard gives me somewhere to put the actual idea, link the related notes, and close the tab like a functional adult.\'94\

