\f0\b\fs36 \cf0 \strokec2 15. \'93The problem with \'91all-in-one\'92 apps\'94\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Hook:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93Most all-in-one apps feel like they want me to move into them.\'94\

\f0\b Talk track:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93I wanted something that feels more like a tool than a lifestyle. DevBoard gives you the useful parts: notes, links, board, files. But it doesn\'92t ask you to rebuild your personality around a template.\'94\

