\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs24 \cf0 Hook:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93If you\'92re building something alone, context switching is brutal.\'94\

\f0\b Talk track:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93You\'92re writing specs, sketching flows, tracking ideas, and making little decisions constantly. DevBoard keeps that messy thinking in one workspace so you don\'92t have to keep rebuilding context.\'94\

