\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93My product planning used to be spread across notes, whiteboards, and random docs.\'94\

\f0\b Talk track:
\f1\b0 \uc0\u8232 \'93Now I use DevBoard as the place where the idea is allowed to be unfinished. I can sketch the flow, write the note, keep the files, and slowly turn the mess into something real.\'94\

